; A posting counts on its own date: tag, not on the transaction date or the secondary date.
P 2026-01-01 X 1 EUR
P 2026-02-01 X 2 EUR
P 2026-04-01 X 4 EUR
P 2026-06-01 X 6 EUR

; a is dated 01-05, b 05-05 (the transaction says 03-01)
2026-03-01 posting dates
    a   10 X  ; date:2026-01-05
    b  -10 X  ; date:2026-05-05

; secondary date 05-25 plays no part: the lot counts from 01-20
2026-01-20=2026-05-25 secondary date
    c   1 X
    d  -1 X
